stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> TRIGGER
    TRIGGER --> PRECHECK
    PRECHECK --> NO_OP : Goal already satisfied
    PRECHECK --> EXECUTE : Goal not yet satisfied
    PRECHECK --> EXHAUSTED : Budget ceiling hit at loop top
    EXECUTE --> VERIFY
    VERIFY --> SUCCESS : L1-L5 pass + streak met + enumeration satisfied
    VERIFY --> EXECUTE : Fail but progress made, budget remains
    VERIFY --> PRECHECK : Pass but streak not yet confirmed
    VERIFY --> STALLED : No progress for K turns (stagnation detector fired)
    VERIFY --> BLOCKED : External dependency / human decision required
    VERIFY --> EXHAUSTED : Budget ceiling hit
    SUCCESS --> [*]
    NO_OP --> [*]
    STALLED --> [*] : Preserve last-known-good state
    BLOCKED --> [*] : Escalate to human, park on disk
    EXHAUSTED --> [*] : Abort, partial artifact only if verified
    ERROR --> [*] : Never counted as success (error ≠ success)
